	(text_box "Window comparator using the LM393 needs an external voltage reference such as the TL431 or the LM4040/LM385.\n\nIdeally you'll want to use at least +/-1% precision resistors.\n\nThe input range for Vsupply is 2.0Vdc - 36Vdc and the output is open collector and uses the pull-up resistor to get the needed \nlogic high voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 76.2 0)
